        "node_id": "n_1_4e1b79",
        "thought_text": "Calculate the first differences of the input sequence and check if they are constant. If they are, the degree of the polynomial is 1. If not, calculate the second differences and repeat until a constant difference is found. The number of times differences are calculated before finding a constant difference will give the degree of the polynomial. Use this degree to predict the next value in the sequence.",
